sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor You
  participant H as Hashi
  participant E as Your Ethereum wallet
  participant N as NEAR Intents
  participant K as This swap's contract
  participant C as Cauldron
  participant B as Your Bitcoin Cash wallet
  You->>H: 50 USDC on Ethereum → PUSD
  H->>N: price-only quotes (THORChain too)
  H->>C: price the BCH → PUSD leg
  H-->>You: NEAR Intents → Cauldron: 49.83 PUSD, at least 49.33, ~3 min, 1 approval
  You->>H: Start swap
  H->>K: a contract for this swap: it pays only your wallet, at least 49.33 PUSD
  H->>N: real quote: a deposit address that pays the contract
  H->>E: the only approval: send 50 USDC to that address
  E->>N: 50 USDC
  loop every 5 s until it settles
    H->>N: status?
  end
  N->>K: BCH to the contract (p… address)
  H->>C: build the trade from the contract's BCH
  H->>K: sign with this swap's own key (no wallet prompt), check it in the VM, broadcast
  C-->>B: PUSD to your token (z…) address
  Note over K,B: If the trade cannot happen, the BCH goes back to your wallet
